---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import essays from "../assets/essays.png";
---

<Layout title="Essays | Anson Chan">
<main class="page-container">

<!-- 1. HERO SECTION (Identical to Homepage) -->
<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-text">

<h1>Essays</h1>
<p class="bio-text">
Beyond my research, I write about technologies, philosophy, cities, and ideas that shape humanities.
</p>      
</div>

<div class="hero-photo">
<img src={essays.src} alt="Essays" class="hero-icon" />
</div>
</section>

<!-- 2. ESSAYS LIST -->
<section class="essay-list">
      
<!-- Topic 1 -->
<article class="essay-item">
<div class="essay-meta">
<span class="mono-date">Upcoming</span>
</div>

<div class="essay-content">
<h3>
<a href="#" class="essay-link">What construction safety can teach AI safety</a>
</h3>

<p class="essay-desc">
Civil engineering has spent a century mastering safety in high-stakes physical environments, such as buildings and bridges.
</p>

<p class="essay-desc">
How about applying these "safety guardrails" from the physical world to steer AI?
</p>

</div>
</article>

<!-- Topic 2 -->
<article class="essay-item">
<div class="essay-meta">
<span class="mono-date">Upcoming</span>
</div>

<div class="essay-content">
<h3>
<a href="#" class="essay-link">Why do a PhD when AI can code <em>almost</em> everything?</a>
</h3>

<p class="essay-desc">
If AI can write code, generate papers, and even design experiments on its own, what is the point of doing a PhD? 
A reflection on the role of scientists and researchers in the age of AI.          
</p>

</div>
</article>

<!-- Topic 3 -->
<article class="essay-item">
<div class="essay-meta">
<span class="mono-date">Upcoming</span>
</div>

<div class="essay-content">
<h3>
<a href="#" class="essay-link">Why decision intelligence matters: from prediction to decision</a>
</h3>

<p class="essay-desc">
Moving beyond "Prediction" (what will happen) to "Decision" (what we should do). 
The missing layer in most of the existing AI models: translating uncertainties and objectives into actions.
</p>

</div>
</article>

<!-- Topic 4 -->
<article class="essay-item">
<div class="essay-meta">
<span class="mono-date">Upcoming</span>
</div>

<div class="essay-content">
<h3>
<a href="#" class="essay-link">Future of cities: from Nordic regionalism to Hong Kong Northern Metropolis
(未來城市: 從北歐區域主義到香港北部都會區)</a>
</h3>

<p class="essay-desc">
The Northern Metropolis is a bold vision to inject new economic momentum into Hong Kong,
while establishing a closer connection with the Shenzhen-based tech hubs in mainland China.
However, cross-border challenges in governance, culture, and sustainability integration remain.
</p>

<p class="essay-desc">
What can Nordic regionalism teach us about creating human-centric and sustainable cities?
</p>

</div>
</article>

<!-- Topic 5 -->
<article class="essay-item">
<div class="essay-meta">
<span class="mono-date">Upcoming</span>
</div>

<div class="essay-content">
<h3>
<a href="#" class="essay-link">Green retrofitting is not an optimisation problem</a>
</h3>

<p class="essay-desc">
Trade-offs between energy efficiency, cost, and occupant comfort cannot be reduced to a mathematical optimisation problem
or solved by computing a Pareto front alone.
</p>

<p class="essay-desc">
If we want to accelerate the net zero progress, we need to address the socio-technical challenges 
that require human judgment, stakeholder engagement, and ethical considerations.         
</p>

</div>
</article>

</section>

</main>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* =========================================
     1. PAGE LAYOUT
     ========================================= */
  .page-container {
    max-width: 1100px; 
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem 6rem;
  }

  /* =========================================
     2. HERO SECTION (Identical to Homepage)
     ========================================= */
  .hero {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    gap: 5rem;
    padding: 5rem 0 5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-text {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: #111;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .bio-text {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #444;
    margin: 0;
  }
  
  .hero-photo { flex-shrink: 0; }
  
  .hero-icon {
    width: 200px;
    height: 200px;
    object-fit: contain;
    /* Optional: Rounded like profile if desired */
    border-radius: 50%; 
    background: #f9f9f9;
  }

  /* =========================================
     3. ESSAY LIST STYLES
     ========================================= */
  .essay-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .essay-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem; 
    padding: 2.5rem 0; /* Breathing room */
    border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; 
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .essay-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

  /* Date Column */
  .essay-meta {
    width: 120px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .mono-date {
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #888;
    display: block;
  }

  /* Content Column */
  .essay-content {
    flex: 1;
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  /* 🛠️ TITLE LINK (Forced Blue) */
  .essay-link {
    font-size: 1.35rem; 
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0067c0; /* 🎯 Academic Blue */
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .essay-link:hover {
    color: #004b99; /* Darker blue hover */
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .essay-desc {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem 0; /* Space before "Coming Soon" */
  }

  /* 🛠️ "COMING SOON" ITALIC TEXT */
  .coming-soon {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #888;
    display: block;
  }

  /* MOBILE RESPONSIVE */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero { flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: flex-start; gap: 2rem; }
    .hero-icon { width: 120px; height: 120px; }
    .essay-item { flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .essay-meta { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
